1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:06,540
What is a polysemous word?

2
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:13,420
A polysemous word is a word with one original meaning

3
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:19,540
and one or several transferred meanings,

4
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:30,880
meanings of a polysemous word always have a connection with each other.

